Winston and Swarm are projects of the USGS Volcano Hazards Program

They are provided here as a convenience for Earthworm users. Despite being in 
the 'src' directory, the source is not provided here to avoid branching issues. 
The active source can be found on github at 
https://github.com/usgs/winston
https://github.com/usgs/swarm

Latest Swarm build:
https://volcanoes.usgs.gov/software/swarm/download.shtml

Latest Winston Build:
http://volcanoes.usgs.gov/software/winston/

Swarm requires a Java Runtime Environment (JRE) version 8 or above. 
Winston requires JRE version 6 or above. 
The Java JRE can be downloaded from the official Java website 
http://www.java.com/en/download/ or the Oracle wite Java 
http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/javase/downloads/index.html website. 
